  s0: Not recording | gate off in the page
  s1: Not recording | gate off in the page | navigation under way | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s2: Not recording | gate off in the page | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline | toolbar shows loading, window shows off
  s3: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline | toolbar shows loading, window shows off
  s4: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline | toolbar shows recording, window shows off
  s5: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline
  s6: Recording | gate off in the page (switch-on on its way) | on the new page | click 1: reached the page#59; report on its way#59; not in the timeline | toolbar shows off, window shows recording
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you click (click 1): it reaches the page untouched and starts a navigation
  s1 --> s2: the new page loads
  s2 --> s2: the recorder answers the new page's question about the state
  s2 --> s3: you press Record
  s3 --> s3: the recorder announces its new state
  s3 --> s4: the announcement reaches the toolbar
  s4 --> s5: that answer reaches the toolbar
  s5 --> s6: the window catches up
